[`pingora-core/src/protocols/http/subrequest/server.rs#L155-L161`](https://github.com/cloudflare/pingora/blob/e6e677fe9b58555140ab7bd14feff035392b3530/pingora-core/src/protocols/http/subrequest/server.rs#L155-L161)

